flowchart TD
  Operation[Enabled operation] --> Selected{Exact selected input?}
  Selected -->|No| Ignore[No freshness incident]
  Selected -->|Yes| Deadline[Real consumed deadline]
  Deadline --> Due{Renewal due?}
  Deadline --> Prevent{Preventive milestone reached?}
  Prevent -->|Operator 7d / 3d / 1d or automatic 48h / 24h| Task[Durable current-stage task]
  Task --> Notice[Unique operational notice per occurrence and stage]
  Notice --> Gate{Explicit operational email activation?}
  Gate -->|No| Report[Private aggregate action report]
  Gate -->|Yes| Claim[One claim within hourly and daily caps]
  Claim --> Outcome{Provider acknowledgement?}
  Outcome -->|Known and persisted| Accepted[Accepted notice; delivery unproven]
  Outcome -->|Refused or uncertain| Hold[Retain failed or unknown; no automatic retry]
  Due -->|Yes| Technical{Technical renewal allowed?}
  Technical -->|Yes| Inspect[Bounded real source inspection]
  Technical -->|No| Authority[Preserve the independent authority deadline]
  Authority --> Watch
  Inspect --> Binding{Exact current bindings valid?}
  Binding -->|Yes| Commitment{Earlier commitments safe?}
  Commitment -->|Yes| Revision[Atomic immutable revision]
  Commitment -->|No| Defer[Defer and preserve commitments]
  Binding -->|No| Preserve[Keep earlier evidence unchanged]
  Revision --> Resolve[Resolve prior incident for this binding]
  Due -->|No| Watch[Wait for next scheduled check]
  Defer --> Watch
  Preserve --> Watch
  Watch --> Risk{Within twenty-four hours?}
  Risk -->|Yes| Incident[Durable idempotent incident]
  Incident --> Alert[Distinct freshness signal to existing operations channel]
  Risk -->|No| Watch
  Alert --> Expired{Real deadline reached?}
  Expired -->|Yes and still invalid| Stop[Close only the affected operation]
  Expired -->|No| Watch
  Stop --> Due
